el": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Bassbear%21%21%2C+DJ+Swisha+%26+Kanyon+Eric+Phresh", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Bassbear%21%21%2C+DJ+Swisha+%26+Kanyon+Eric+Phresh", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/artist/64903002", "search": false}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Bassbear%21%21%2C+DJ+Swisha+%26+Kanyon+Eric+Phresh&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“going into some old bass bear, the collab that he did with DJ Swisher and Canyon ... yeah that this one's called Eric Fresh”", "2024 EP 'Eric Phresh' by Bassbear!!, DJ Swisha & Kanyon, containing a title track 'Eric Phresh'; confirmed via DJ Swisha's Deezer/Apple Music catalog (no free-listen link located)."]}, {"t": 6600, "time": "01:50:00", "artist": "Dezrok", "title": "Trance Machine (Full Mix)", "conf": "low", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Dezrok+Trance+Machine+%28Full+Mix%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": []}, {"t": 6989, "time": "01:56:29", "artist": "Hannes Seifert", "title": "Wacky Kart: WKTrack 3 (Originalversion)", "conf": "low", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Hannes+Seifert+Wacky+Kart%3A+WKTrack+3+%28Originalversion%29", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Hannes+Seifert+Wacky+Kart%3A+WKTrack+3+%28Originalversion%29", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Hannes+Seifert+Wacky+Kart%3A+WKTrack+3+%28Originalversion%29", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Hannes+Seifert+Wacky+Kart%3A+WKTrack+3+%28Originalversion%29", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/401124771", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Hannes+Seifert+Wacky+Kart%3A+WKTrack+3+%28Originalversion%29", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Hannes+Seifert+Wacky+Kart%3A+WKTrack+3+%28Originalversion%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["1991 Osutoria Holding GmbH"]}], "counts": {"high": 2, "mid": 12, "low": 13}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:00:45", "text": "For sharing your vision, for sharing your idea and it is doing a lot for the community and is something that I think everyone needs to experience. At the end of the day, everybody inherently loves House in my opinion. So if you're not there, I don't know what to tell you. I will be there, some amazing DJs, creatives and again different people from different facets of the African space will be there to share the beauty of that sound. but with all that being said thank you all for tuning in to yanos this week it has been an amazing time having a great discussion and we hope to see you all next week saturday for sure for sure this was the on our show thank you all for staying tuned see you next week"}, {"start": "00:03:39", "end": "00:04:06", "text": "You are listening to Saturday Sunset with Dot Zip. Before we start, I'd like to acknowledge that we are broadcasting live from stolen Gadigal land in the heart of Redfern, Waterloo, always was, always will be Aboriginal land and sovereignty has never ceded."}, {"start": "00:05:03", "end": "00:05:29", "text": "For today's show I thought to do something a little different for the first hour or so I'm going to just play a few of my favourite Detroit techno tracks in honour of Juan Atkins, rest in peace, The Godfather of Techno and yeah this first one is The Flow by Model 500."}, {"start": "00:13:55", "end": "00:14:17", "text": "You are listening to Saturday Sunset with Dot Zip, playing a few of my favourite Detroit techno tracks and classics. Under Us is a track by Cybertron, a.k.a. Juan Atkins of Model 500, Alleys of Your Mind."}, {"start": "01:04:14", "end": "01:04:53", "text": "You are listening to Saturday Sunset with me, SovBlackPussy, aka Wanita. I hope you enjoyed the first half of the show. The second half, yeah, just going to have a little bit of a mix. Play some kind of like techno, clubby stuff. some things that I've been listening to new and old and stuff that I have been playing out in my sets um yeah this first one is Night Skyline by DJ Daria"}, {"start": "01:23:37", "end": "01:24:07", "text": "Saturday Sunset, Myself, Sob, Black Pussy in the Mix, Under Us is a track by 1010, kind of like a Treball, Techno-y tool that I've been loving, I've been rinsing that whole record this year. Before that was some Old Cooler, Tan Tan, Lior, some Regal 86. Keep it locked, I'm here until 8pm."}, {"start": "01:39:05", "end": "01:39:50", "text": "Under Us is a track by Witchcraft 1 & 2. I think that record was released earlier in the year. I've also been rinsing every track off of that record this year in a lot of my certs. And going into some old bass bear, the collab that he did with DJ Swisher and Canyon. I think, yeah, this record is extremely underrated. I love how clubby and breaky it is but also it has like old kind of Detroit techno like sounds and synths which I love um yeah that this one's called Eric Fresh"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:01:00"}, "track": {"title": "The Rapture Pt. III", "artists": [{"name": "&ME & Black Coffee"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:00"}, "track": {"title": "Xtasis (feat. Dj Babatr)", "artists": [{"name": "Nick León"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:04"}, "track": {"title": "The Flow", "artists": [{"name": "Model 500"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:09:18"}, "track": {"title": "Paradise", "artists": [{"name": "Inner City"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:13:15"}, "track": {"title": "Alleys Of Your Mind", "artists": [{"name": "Cybotron"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:16:44"}, "track": {"title": "I Love You", "artists": [{"name": "Juan Atkins"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:28:00"}, "track": {"title": "Timeline", "artists": [{"name": "Galaxy 2 Galaxy"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:31:44"}, "track": {"title": "Heavenly (Juan Atkins Mix)", "artists": [{"name": "E-Dancer & Kevin Saunderson"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:36:50"}, "track": {"title": "Quetzel", "artists": [{"name": "Los Hermanos"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:38:08"}, "track": {"title": "XYZ", "artists": [{"name": "deadmau5"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:43:00"}, "track": {"title": "Lose Control (feat. Ciara & Fat Man Scoop)", "artists": [{"name": "Missy Elliott"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true,